        "Content": "Accommodation Comprises:\r\nEntrance Hallway – (3.1m x 2.4m),  Laminate floors.\r\nLiving Room – (4.7mx 3.9m),  Feature fireplace, door to kitchen.\r\nInner Hallway – (11m x 1m),  Access to attic, laminate floors.\r\nKitchen/Diner – (10.1m x 3.7m), Fully fitted eye & waist level kitchen units, feature stove, TV point, tiled floors, part tiled walls, double doors to utility room.\r\nBack Porch – (2.2m x 2.6m),  Tiled floor, door to rear garden.\r\nUtility Room – (1.5m x 2.1m),  Fully plumbed.\r\nBathroom – (3.5m x 1.8m),  WC, WHB, Bath, part tiled walls, tiled floor, built in hotpress.\r\nBedroom No. 1 – (3.4m x 2.9m),  Built in wardrobe, WHB.\r\nBedroom No. 2 – (3.2m x 2.8m),  Built in wardrobe, WHB with built in vanity unit.\r\nBedroom No. 3 – (3.3m x 3.5m),  En-Suite.\r\nEn-Suite – (3.2m x 0.8m),  WC, WHB, shower, fully tiled.\r\nSeparate WC – (0.9m x 1.2m),  WC, WHB.\r\nBedroom No. 4 – (4.6m x 2.9m)\r\nEn-Suite – (2.1m x 2.1m),  WC, WHB, tiled floors, part tiled walls.\r\nLounge – (5.7m x 3.6m) Solid natural wood floor, feature fireplace, bay window, coving with centre rose, sliding door to patio.\r\nBedroom No. 5 – (3.5m x 3.1m),  Coving.\r\nEn-Suite – (0.9m x 3m),  WC, WHB, shower, part tiled walls, tiled floor.\r\nOffi\u001dce/Study – (3.2m x 2.8m), Built in storage.\r\n\r\nOutside: Spacious gardens to front and rear, good parking, patio area.\r\nServices: Electricity, mains water, private sewerage, oil fired central heating.\r\nBER: D Ber No: 105411375 Performance indicator: 233.05 kWh/m2/yr\r\nApply: Keane Auctioneers (053) 9123072"
